<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns:m='http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Modul_Multi_Bahasa_Inggris_Kelas_IX_Report_Text</title><style>
/* Reset dasar */
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;min-height:0!important;max-height:none!important;
  height:auto!important;flex:none!important;overflow:visible!important;
  position:static!important;float:none!important}
/* Typography */
body{font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.5;color:#000;background:#fff}
/* Tables */
table{width:100%!important;border-collapse:collapse!important;margin-bottom:12px;
  display:table!important;table-layout:fixed!important}
tr{display:table-row!important}
td,th{border:1px solid #000;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top;
  display:table-cell!important;word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word}
/* Headings */
h1{font-size:16pt;font-weight:bold;margin:12px 0 6px}
h2{font-size:14pt;font-weight:bold;margin:10px 0 5px}
h3{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;margin:8px 0 4px}
h4,h5,h6{font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;margin:6px 0 3px}
/* Paragraphs & lists */
p{margin:4px 0;line-height:1.5}
ul,ol{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}
li{margin:2px 0}
/* Inline */
sup{vertical-align:super;font-size:0.75em}
sub{vertical-align:sub;font-size:0.75em}
b,strong{font-weight:bold}
i,em{font-style:italic}
u{text-decoration:underline}
/* Images */
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
/* Page breaks (dikendalikan pruneV2ExportSections) */
.page-break-before{page-break-before:always!important;break-before:page!important}
/* Section wrappers */
[data-v2-export-item]{display:block!important}
/* Div/span umum */
div,span,section,article,main,header,footer,nav,aside{display:block}
</style></head><body><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-1-dad88559:modul" data-v2-export-jenis="modul" data-v2-export-pertemuan="1"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 1 — Modul</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="modul" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 3px solid black; padding-bottom: 10px;"><h1 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px; text-transform: uppercase;">MODUL AJAR: BAHASA INGGRIS</h1><p class="italic">Materi: Report Text - Kelas Kelas IX</p></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 20px; table-layout: fixed;"><colgroup><col style="width: 30%;"><col style="width: 70%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="background-color: rgb(226, 232, 240);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">I. IDENTIFIKASI DASAR</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Identitas Umum</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; vertical-align: top;"><div><strong>Nama Penyusun:</strong> Fitri Aini</div><div><strong>Sekolah:</strong> SMP Sukamaju </div><div><strong>Mata Pelajaran:</strong> Bahasa Inggris</div><div><strong>Materi:</strong> Report Text </div><div><strong>Kelas/Fase:</strong> Kelas IX / D</div><div><strong>Semester:</strong> 1 (Ganjil)</div><div><strong>Jumlah Pertemuan:</strong> 2 (160 Menit)</div></td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(219, 234, 254);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">II. IDENTIFIKASI MURID</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Aspek Pengetahuan Awal</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Murid sudah mengenal kalimat sederhana dan kosakata umum, namun belum terbiasa dengan struktur teks laporan yang bersifat objektif.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Aspek Minat</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Murid fase D tertarik pada konten visual, teknologi digital, dan isu-isu lingkungan atau hobi yang sedang tren.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Aspek Latar Belakang</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Murid berasal dari latar belakang yang heterogen, terbiasa dengan budaya kolaborasi namun memerlukan bimbingan dalam berpikir kritis.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Aspek Kebutuhan Belajar</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Memerlukan scaffolding dalam menyusun kalimat majemuk dan pemahaman konsep objektifitas teks.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(209, 250, 229);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">III. JENIS PENGETAHUAN MATERI</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Faktual</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Struktur teks (General classification, description), kosakata teknis, fakta-fakta tentang benda/fenomena.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Konseptual</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Tujuan sosial teks laporan (to inform), ciri objektifitas, penggunaan simple present tense.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Prosedural</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Langkah menyusun kerangka teks, mengolah data menjadi informasi, dan membuat infografis.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Metakognitif</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Strategi membedakan antara opini dan fakta dalam penulisan ilmiah.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Kaitan dengan Kehidupan</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Menerapkan teks laporan untuk menjelaskan fenomena di sekitar, seperti kebersihan lingkungan, jenis tanaman, atau gadget.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(254, 243, 199);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">IV. INTEGRASI NILAI &amp; KARAKTER</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Nilai Karakter</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Kritis dan Kreatif, Kolaborasi, Tanggung Jawab, Komunikatif</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(224, 231, 255);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">V. DIMENSI PROFIL LULUSAN</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">DPL yang Dikembangkan</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 16px;"><li style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>DPL 3:</strong> Penalaran Kritis</li><li style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>DPL 4:</strong> Kreativitas</li><li style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>DPL 5:</strong> Kolaborasi</li><li style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>DPL 8:</strong> Komunikasi</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 20px; table-layout: fixed;"><colgroup><col style="width: 30%;"><col style="width: 70%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="background-color: rgb(226, 232, 240);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">VI. DESAIN PEMBELAJARAN</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Capaian Pembelajaran</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"><span>Murid mampu menganalisis gagasan utama dan informasi tersurat dari teks laporan, menjelaskan struktur teks serta unsur kebahasaan yang tepat, serta merancang teks laporan multimodal tentang topik sehari-hari dengan menggunakan kalimat sederhana dan majemuk sesuai konteks.</span></td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Tujuan Pembelajaran</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><span>TP1: Peserta didik mampu menjelaskan struktur teks dan unsur kebahasaan yang terdapat dalam teks laporan sederhana.<br>TP2: Peserta didik mampu menganalisis gagasan utama dan informasi tersurat dari berbagai contoh teks laporan bertopik sehari-hari.<br>TP3: Peserta didik mampu merancang teks laporan multimodal dengan menerapkan kalimat sederhana dan majemuk yang sesuai dengan konteks.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Pemahaman Bermakna</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><span>Murid memahami bahwa teks laporan bukan sekadar tugas menulis, melainkan sarana untuk mengomunikasikan fakta objektif tentang dunia sekitar secara sistematis dan akurat.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Model Pembelajaran</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Project Based Learning (PjBL)</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Metode Pembelajaran</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Diskusi Kelompok, Studi Kasus, Pengumpulan Data, Presentasi Proyek</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(240, 253, 244);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">VII. LINTAS DISIPLIN ILMU</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">PPKn</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Menganalisis tanggung jawab dalam menyebarkan informasi fakta.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">IPS</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Penggunaan data geografi atau sosial sebagai objek teks laporan.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(252, 231, 243);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">VIII. KEMITRAAN PEMBELAJARAN</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Guru Bidang Studi Lain</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Guru TIK untuk dukungan desain infografis.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Orang Tua</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Orang tua mendampingi dalam riset topik di rumah.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Instansi Terkait</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Perpustakaan sekolah sebagai sumber data riset.</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(207, 250, 254);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">IX. LINGKUNGAN PEMBELAJARAN</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Ruang Fisik</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Ruang kelas dengan meja berkelompok.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Ruang Virtual</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Google Classroom atau Padlet untuk berbagi hasil karya.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Budaya Belajar</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Budaya bertanya dan saling memberi umpan balik (peer feedback).</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(237, 233, 254);"><td colspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">X. PEMANFAATAN DIGITAL</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Perencanaan</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Browsing sumber data terpercaya (internet).</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Pelaksanaan</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Aplikasi desain grafis (Canva/sejenisnya).</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; font-weight: bold;">Asesmen</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">Rubrik penilaian digital melalui Google Form.</td></tr></tbody></table><div style="margin-bottom: 30px;"><div style="background-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 16px; border: 1px solid black;">XI. PENGALAMAN BELAJAR (LANGKAH PEMBELAJARAN)</div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; table-layout: fixed;"><colgroup><col style="width: 18%;"><col style="width: 67%;"><col style="width: 15%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249); text-align: center;"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">TAHAP</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">KEGIATAN &amp; PRINSIP</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">DURASI</th></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(199, 210, 254);"><td colspan="3" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">PERTEMUAN 1 (80 Menit)</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(219, 234, 254);">Pendahuluan</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Orientasi</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Salam, Doa, dan Tujuan (4 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru membuka pembelajaran dengan salam dan doa bersama.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru menyampaikan tujuan pembelajaran hari ini yakni menganalisis dan merancang teks laporan sederhana.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menyimak dan mengaitkan tujuan dengan minat mereka terhadap fenomena alam/sosial.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Membangun kesadaran (Mindful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">4 menit</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Apersepsi</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Brainstorming Fenomena (3 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru menunjukkan foto hewan unik atau fenomena alam.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menebak apa yang terjadi dan bagaimana menjelaskan fenomena tersebut secara ilmiah.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru mengajukan pertanyaan pemantik: 'Bagaimana cara kita menjelaskan fakta tentang sesuatu agar orang lain tidak salah paham?'</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Bermakna (Meaningful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">3 menit</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Motivasi</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Ice Breaking (3 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru mengadakan permainan tebak fakta 'Fact or Myth' singkat.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menjawab dengan antusias dan tertawa bersama saat menemukan fakta unik.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Menggembirakan (Joyful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">3 menit</td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(209, 250, 229);"><td colspan="3" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">TAHAP INTI - INTI<span style="font-weight: normal; margin-left: 8px; font-style: italic;">(Model: Project Based Learning (PjBL))</span><div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px;">Durasi Total: 55 menit | Bermakna, Membangun kesadaran, Menggembirakan</div></td></tr><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; width: 15%;">FASE</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">KEGIATAN &amp; PRINSIP</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; width: 10%;">DURASI</th></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(209, 250, 229); width: 15%;"><div style="font-size: 1.1em;">🔍 MEMAHAMI</div><div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; font-style: italic;">(20 menit)</div><div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; color: rgb(5, 150, 105);">★ Bermakna, Membangun kesadaran (Meaningful, Mindful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Penentuan Pertanyaan Mendasar &amp; Observasi</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Diskusi Teks Laporan (20 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru menyajikan teks laporan sederhana tentang lingkungan sekolah.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid dalam kelompok mengidentifikasi struktur teks (General Classification &amp; Description).</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru mengajukan pertanyaan pemantik: 'Mengapa teks laporan harus bersifat objektif dan tidak boleh memasukkan opini penulis?'</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid mendiskusikan perbedaan antara teks laporan dengan teks deskriptif.</span></li></ul><div style="margin-left: 12px; background-color: rgb(254, 243, 199); padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 4px;"><span style="font-weight: 500; color: rgb(217, 119, 6); font-size: 0.85em;">💡 Pertanyaan Pemantik:</span><ul style="margin-left: 16px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 0px;"><li style="font-size: 0.85em; font-style: italic;">"<span>Apa perbedaan mendasar antara teks yang bersifat umum dan teks yang bersifat pribadi?</span>"</li><li style="font-size: 0.85em; font-style: italic;">"<span>Mengapa penggunaan fakta sangat penting dalam teks laporan?</span>"</li></ul></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Bermakna (Meaningful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">20 menit</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(254, 243, 199); width: 15%;"><div style="font-size: 1.1em;">🛠️ MENGAPLIKASI</div><div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; font-style: italic;">(25 menit)</div><div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; color: rgb(217, 119, 6);">★ Menggembirakan (Joyful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Perencanaan &amp; Monitoring Proyek</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Mini Project: Infografis Laporan (25 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru membagi tugas proyek: membuat rancangan teks laporan singkat tentang benda/fenomena di sekitar dalam bentuk infografis.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menyusun jadwal kerja tim dan memilih media (digital/kertas).</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru memantau kemajuan kelompok dan membantu murid menggunakan kalimat majemuk yang tepat.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid mengaplikasikan unsur kebahasaan yang telah dipelajari ke dalam draf proyek.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Menggembirakan (Joyful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">25 menit</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(219, 234, 254); width: 15%;"><div style="font-size: 1.1em;">💭 MEREFLEKSI</div><div style="font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; font-style: italic;">(10 menit)</div><div style="font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 4px; color: rgb(37, 99, 235);">★ Membangun kesadaran (Mindful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Evaluasi &amp; Presentasi</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Gallery Walk Singkat (10 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menempelkan draf di meja dan kelompok lain memberi umpan balik (peer review).</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru memberikan umpan balik konstruktif mengenai struktur teks.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid merenungkan apa yang perlu diperbaiki dari draf mereka.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Membangun kesadaran (Mindful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">10 menit</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(254, 243, 199);">Penutup</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Refleksi Individu &amp; Kesimpulan</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Jurnal Refleksi (10 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menuliskan satu hal baru yang dipelajari dan satu tantangan dalam menyusun teks laporan.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru memberikan apresiasi atas kreativitas murid.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid menyimpulkan bahwa teks laporan membantu mereka berpikir lebih kritis.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Membangun kesadaran (Mindful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">10 menit</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;"><div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Doa dan Salam</strong></div><div style="margin-left: 8px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 8px;"><div style="font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px;">• Penutup (5 menit)</div><ul style="margin-left: 12px; margin-top: 2px; list-style-type: disc; margin-bottom: 4px;"><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Guru menutup kelas dengan motivasi positif.</span></li><li style="font-size: 0.9em;"><span>Murid memimpin doa penutup dan mengucapkan salam.</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(107, 114, 128); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500;">★ Menggembirakan (Joyful)</div></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">5 menit</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><table style="width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin-top: 50px;"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 50%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">Mengetahui,<br>Kepala Sekolah<br><br><br><br><strong>Abdul Arif, M.Pd.</strong><br><span style="font-size: 10pt;">NIP. -</span></td><td style="width: 50%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">Guru Mata Pelajaran<br><br><br><br><br><strong>Fitri Aini</strong><br><span style="font-size: 10pt;">NIP. -</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-1-dad88559:lkpd" data-v2-export-jenis="lkpd" data-v2-export-pertemuan="1" class="page-break-before" style="break-before: page;"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 1 — LKPD</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="lkpd" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><div style=""></div><h2 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4px;">LEMBAR KERJA PESERTA DIDIK</h2><p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 24px;">Model: Deep Learning 2026</p><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12px;">Deconstructing the Report</h3><div style="background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251); padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(75, 85, 99);">📖 Bacaan:</strong><p style="text-align: justify; white-space: pre-line; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span>Honey bees are flying insects known for their role in pollination and for producing honey and beeswax. They belong to the genus Apis. Honey bees live in colonies. A colony consists of a queen, drones, and workers. The queen is the only fertile female in the colony. Drones are male bees whose main job is to mate with the queen. Workers are sterile females that perform all the tasks in the hive, such as collecting nectar, cleaning the hive, and protecting the colony. Honey bees communicate through a series of movements known as the waggle dance to inform other bees about the location of food sources.</span></p></div><p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><span>Read the text about Honey Bees. Identify the General Classification and the Description parts. Highlight the relating verbs and the general nouns used in the text.</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>Which paragraph serves as the General Classification?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>What specific details are provided in the Description section?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>Identify two relating verbs found in the text.</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>Why is this text classified as a report text rather than a narrative?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12px;">Mapping the Main Ideas</h3><div style="background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251); padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(75, 85, 99);">📖 Bacaan:</strong><p style="text-align: justify; white-space: pre-line; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span>Honey bees are flying insects known for their role in pollination and for producing honey and beeswax. They belong to the genus Apis. Honey bees live in colonies. A colony consists of a queen, drones, and workers. The queen is the only fertile female in the colony. Drones are male bees whose main job is to mate with the queen. Workers are sterile females that perform all the tasks in the hive, such as collecting nectar, cleaning the hive, and protecting the colony. Honey bees communicate through a series of movements known as the waggle dance to inform other bees about the location of food sources.</span></p></div><p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><span>Work with your partner to extract the main idea of each paragraph and list the explicit information regarding the roles of the bees.</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>What is the main idea of the first paragraph?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>What are the three types of bees mentioned in the text?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span>What is the specific function of the 'waggle dance'?</span></p><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;"><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(156, 163, 175); height: 80px; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"><span style="color: rgb(156, 163, 175); font-size: 9pt;">Jawaban:</span><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-1-dad88559:asesmen" data-v2-export-jenis="asesmen" data-v2-export-pertemuan="1" class="page-break-before" style="break-before: page;"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 1 — Asesmen</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="asesmen" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><div style=""></div><h2 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">Instrumen Asesmen Pembelajaran</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">A. ASESMEN AWAL PEMBELAJARAN (Diagnostik)</h3><p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">Mengidentifikasi pemahaman awal siswa mengenai teks laporan (report text) dan membedakannya dengan teks deskriptif.</p><p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Metode:</strong> Pertanyaan Lisan</p><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 5%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 55%;">Pertanyaan Pemantik</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 40%;">Tujuan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Jika kalian ingin memberikan informasi faktual tentang seekor paus, apakah kalian akan menceritakan pengalaman pribadi atau memberikan fakta ilmiah? Mengapa?</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Menggali pemahaman siswa tentang fungsi sosial teks laporan (faktual vs personal).</span></td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Apa perbedaan utama antara teks yang mendeskripsikan satu benda spesifik (misal: kucing saya 'Kitty') dengan teks yang menjelaskan tentang kucing secara umum?</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Menggali pengetahuan awal tentang struktur teks (general classification vs description).</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">B. ASESMEN PROSES PEMBELAJARAN (Formatif)</h3><p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pemantauan formatif melalui diskusi kelompok untuk menganalisis struktur dan unsur kebahasaan teks laporan.</p><p style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>Metode:</strong> Observasi, Penilaian Kinerja, Diskusi Kelompok</p><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><h4 style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Aktivitas 1: Analisis Struktur Teks Laporan</h4><p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Instruksi:</strong> <span>Dalam kelompok, bacalah teks laporan tentang 'Plastic Pollution'. Tandai bagian General Classification dan Description menggunakan stabilo warna berbeda.</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Pertanyaan Diskusi:</strong><ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px; list-style-type: disc;"><li><span>Apa subjek utama dari teks tersebut?</span></li><li><span>Informasi apa yang ditemukan di paragraf kedua yang mendukung subjek utama?</span></li></ul></div><div><strong>Kunci Jawaban:</strong><ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px; list-style-type: disc;"><li><span>Subjek: Plastic Pollution.</span></li><li><span>Paragraf kedua berisi rincian tentang dampak lingkungan dan jenis limbah plastik.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-top: 16px;"><h4 style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Rubrik Penilaian Proses</h4><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Aspek</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Sangat Baik (4)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Baik (3)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Cukup (2)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Kurang (1)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Partisipasi Diskusi</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Aktif memberikan ide relevan dan menghargai pendapat teman.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Berpartisipasi aktif dalam diskusi.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Pasif namun tetap mengikuti alur diskusi.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Tidak terlibat dalam diskusi kelompok.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-top: 16px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;">📝 Penilaian Diri:</p><ul style="margin-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;"><li><span>Sejauh mana saya memahami perbedaan teks laporan dengan teks deskriptif?</span></li><li><span>Bagian mana dari struktur teks laporan yang masih sulit saya identifikasi?</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-top: 12px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;">👥 Penilaian Sejawat:</p><ul style="margin-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;"><li><span>Apakah rekan kelompok saya memberikan kontribusi pemikiran saat menganalisis teks?</span></li><li><span>Apakah rekan kelompok saya bersikap terbuka terhadap masukan?</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">C. ASESMEN AKHIR PEMBELAJARAN (Sumatif)</h3><p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">Evaluasi sumatif untuk mengukur pemahaman struktur dan analisis informasi tersurat.</p><p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Metode:</strong> Tes Tertulis Uraian</p><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><h4 style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Soal Uraian</h4><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 5%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 45%;">Pertanyaan</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 40%;">Kunci Jawaban</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; width: 10%;">Skor</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Tuliskan perbedaan fungsi sosial antara General Classification dan Description dalam teks laporan!</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>General Classification berfungsi memperkenalkan topik secara umum, sedangkan Description memberikan rincian detail mengenai bagian, perilaku, atau karakteristik objek tersebut.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">50</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Analisis satu kalimat yang menggunakan simple present tense dari teks yang dibaca dan jelaskan mengapa itu digunakan!</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Contoh: 'Plastic is a material that takes hundreds of years to decompose.' Digunakan karena teks laporan menyatakan fakta ilmiah yang bersifat tetap.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: center;">50</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px;"><h4 style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Rubrik Penilaian Akhir</h4><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(241, 245, 249);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Aspek</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Sangat Baik (4)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Baik (3)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Cukup (2)</th><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;">Kurang (1)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Ketepatan Analisis</td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Menjelaskan struktur dan unsur kebahasaan dengan sangat akurat dan logis.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Menjelaskan struktur dan unsur kebahasaan dengan akurat namun penjelasan singkat.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Menjelaskan dengan benar namun kurang tepat dalam memberikan contoh.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;"><span>Tidak mampu menjelaskan struktur atau unsur kebahasaan.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-top: 16px;"><p><strong>Pedoman Penskoran:</strong></p><p>Skor Total: 100</p><p>Rumus Nilai: (Skor Perolehan / Skor Maksimal) x 100</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-1-dad88559:soal" data-v2-export-jenis="soal" data-v2-export-pertemuan="1" class="page-break-before" style="break-before: page;"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 1 — Soal</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="soal" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><div data-subsection="soal-siswa"><h2 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">LEMBAR SOAL</h2><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 1 - 5</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Komodo dragons are the largest lizards on Earth. They live in the islands of Komodo, Rinca, and Padar in Indonesia. These reptiles have a long tail, sharp claws, and a keen sense of smell. They are carnivorous and feed on deer, pigs, and carrion.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">1.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Where do Komodo dragons naturally live?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Sumatra and Java</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Bali and Lombok</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Komodo and Rinca</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Borneo and Papua</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">2.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>What is the primary diet of Komodo dragons?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Small insects</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Various plants</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Deer and pigs</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Ocean fishes</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">3.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Which of these is a physical feature of a Komodo dragon?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Sharp claws</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Soft scales</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Wingspan</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Long horns</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">4.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>What is the main purpose of the text about Komodo dragons?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>To entertain readers</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>To report scientific facts</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>To persuade the tourists</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>To describe a pet</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">5.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Why is the Komodo dragon considered a carnivore?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Because it eats meat</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Because it lives in heat</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Because it is a reptile</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Because it is very large</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 6 - 10</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Angklung is a traditional Indonesian musical instrument made from bamboo tubes. It is originated from West Java. The instrument is played by shaking the bamboo frame to produce a resonant sound. UNESCO recognized Angklung as a Masterpiece of Oral and Intangible Heritage of Humanity.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">6.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Where does the Angklung originate from?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Central Java</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>West Java</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>East Java</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>North Sumatra</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">7.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>How is the Angklung played?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>By blowing it</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>By strumming it</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>By shaking it</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>By hitting it</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">8.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>What status did UNESCO give to the Angklung?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Natural treasure</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Musical masterpiece</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Cultural heritage</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>National symbol</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">9.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>What is the Angklung made of?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Iron tubes</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Bamboo tubes</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Plastic tubes</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Wooden tubes</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">10.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>What is the text about?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">A. <span>Modern music</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">B. <span>Musical tradition</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">C. <span>Bamboo farming</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;">D. <span>Cultural event</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 11 - 12</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Mount Bromo is an active volcano located in East Java, Indonesia. It is part of the Bromo Tengger Semeru National Park. The mountain is famous for its magnificent sunrise view and the vast sea of sand that surrounds the crater.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">11.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Based on the text about Mount Bromo, determine if each statement is True or False.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Mount Bromo is located in Central Java.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Mount Bromo is an active volcano.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Mount Bromo has a sea of sand.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">12.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Based on the text about Mount Bromo, determine if each statement is True or False.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The sunrise view is the main attraction.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Mount Bromo is part of a national park.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>There is no crater in Mount Bromo.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 13 - 14</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Rainforests are dense forests with high annual rainfall. They are often called the lungs of the planet because they produce oxygen. Many rare plants and animals live in these ecosystems, making them vital for global biodiversity.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">13.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Based on the text about Rainforests, determine if each statement is True or False.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Rainforests have low annual rainfall.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; 