d have large, edible seeds. These plants are often cultivated in gardens for their beauty and nutritional value.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">20.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Are these statements true about report texts?</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The purpose is to persuade the reader.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The purpose is to present facts.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They include personal experiences.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 21</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Komodo dragons are the largest lizards on Earth. They live in the islands of Komodo, Rinca, and Padar in Indonesia. These reptiles have a long tail, sharp claws, and a keen sense of smell. They are carnivorous and feed on deer, pigs, and carrion.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">21.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR tentang Komodo dragons berdasarkan teks! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>They are the largest lizards</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>They eat fruits and vegetables</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>They have sharp claws</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>They live in urban areas</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 22</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Angklung is a traditional Indonesian musical instrument made from bamboo tubes. It is originated from West Java. The instrument is played by shaking the bamboo frame to produce a resonant sound. UNESCO recognized Angklung as a Masterpiece of Oral and Intangible Heritage of Humanity.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">22.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR tentang Angklung berdasarkan teks! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>It is made of bamboo</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>It is from West Java</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>It is a modern instrument</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>It is played by blowing</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 23</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Mount Bromo is an active volcano located in East Java, Indonesia. It is part of the Bromo Tengger Semeru National Park. The mountain is famous for its magnificent sunrise view and the vast sea of sand that surrounds the crater.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">23.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR tentang Mount Bromo berdasarkan teks! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>It is an active volcano</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>It has a sea of sand</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>It is in North Sumatra</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>It is the tallest mountain</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 24</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Rainforests are dense forests with high annual rainfall. They are often called the lungs of the planet because they produce oxygen. Many rare plants and animals live in these ecosystems, making them vital for global biodiversity.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">24.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR tentang Rainforests berdasarkan teks! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>They produce oxygen</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>They have low rainfall</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>They contain rare species</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>They are mostly deserts</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 25</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Sunflowers are tall, bright yellow flowers known for their heliotropism. They grow best in full sunlight and have large, edible seeds. These plants are often cultivated in gardens for their beauty and nutritional value.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">25.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR tentang Sunflowers berdasarkan teks! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>They like sunlight</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>They have edible seeds</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>They are short flowers</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>They do not grow in gardens</span></p></div></div></div><div style=""></div><div data-subsection="soal-kisi" style="margin-top: 24px;"><h2 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">KISI-KISI / ANALISIS BUTIR SOAL</h2><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 6%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left; width: 22%;">Tipe Soal</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left; width: 14%;">Level Kognitif</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231,