ad><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">C</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text explicitly states they live in the islands of Komodo, Rinca, and Padar.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">C</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text mentions they are carnivorous and feed on deer, pigs, and carrion.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">A</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text lists sharp claws as one of the physical features.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text provides general information about an animal, which is characteristic of a report text.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">A</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Carnivores are defined as organisms that feed on the flesh of other animals.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text states that the Angklung is originated from West Java.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">7</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">C</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text mentions it is played by shaking the bamboo frame.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">8</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text describes it as a Masterpiece of Oral and Intangible Heritage.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">9</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text explicitly states it is made from bamboo tubes.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">10</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text explains the nature and origin of a traditional musical instrument.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">Pilihan Ganda Kompleks / Benar-Salah</h3><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 8%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left; width: 32%;">Kunci / Pernyataan Benar</th><th style="border: 1px so