lor: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Protecting forests helps climate change</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Rainforests have simple ecosystems</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Oxygen is produced by these forests</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 15 - 16</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Jakarta is the capital city of Indonesia and a massive metropolitan hub. It serves as the center of government, economy, and culture. The city faces challenges such as traffic congestion and seasonal flooding, yet it remains a vibrant center for international trade and domestic tourism.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">15.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>State whether these facts about Jakarta are True or False.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Jakarta is the capital of Indonesia</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The city has no traffic issues</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It is a center for economy</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">16.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Determine the accuracy of these Jakarta-related statements.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Jakarta is a hub for tourism</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Seasonal flooding is a challenge</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The city is a small village</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 17</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Komodo dragons are the largest lizards on Earth, found primarily in the Komodo National Park in Indonesia. These reptiles can grow up to 3 meters long. They are carnivores, feeding on deer, pigs, and occasionally carrion. Their skin is covered in tough scales, and they possess a powerful tail.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">17.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Based on the text, confirm the traits of Komodo dragons.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They are small lizards</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They can reach 3 meters</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They eat plants only</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 18</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>The Rafflesia arnoldii, known as the world's largest individual flower, grows in the rainforests of Sumatra and Kalimantan. It is a parasitic plant that has no visible leaves, roots, or stems. It is famous for its foul odor, which mimics rotting meat to attract pollinating flies.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">18.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Check the facts about the Rafflesia flower.</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It smells like flowers</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It is found in Sumatra</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It attracts flies</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 19</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Wayang Kulit is a traditional Indonesian shadow puppet show. The puppets are crafted from buffalo hide and mounted on bamboo sticks. A dalang, or puppeteer, manipulates the puppets behind a cotton screen illuminated by an oil lamp. It is an essential part of Javanese culture.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">19.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Are these details about Wayang Kulit correct?</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The puppets use bamboo</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The show is done in the dark</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The puppets are made of hide</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for question number 20</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Rainforests are complex ecosystems with high biodiversity. They are often called the lungs of the planet because they absorb carbon dioxide and release oxygen. Protecting these forests is crucial to mitigating global climate change and preserving thousands of unique species.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">20.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Is this information about rainforests accurate?</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Salah</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They absorb carbon dioxide</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Species are not unique there</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They are globally irrelevant</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">Text for questions number 21 - 25</p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px;"><span>Jakarta is the capital city of Indonesia and a massive metropolitan hub. It serves as the center of government, economy, and culture. The city faces challenges such as traffic congestion and seasonal flooding, yet it remains a vibrant center for international trade and domestic tourism.</span></p></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">21.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR berdasarkan teks tentang Jakarta! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>Jakarta is the capital city</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>Traffic is not a problem</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>Jakarta is a metropolitan hub</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>Flooding never happens</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">22.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR berdasarkan teks tentang Jakarta! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>It is a government center</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>It is a quiet small city</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>It has economic importance</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>It has no tourism</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">23.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR berdasarkan teks tentang Jakarta! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>Jakarta is a vibrant city</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>Traffic is a major issue</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>It lacks any infrastructure</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>It is an international hub</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">24.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR berdasarkan teks tentang Jakarta! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>Jakarta faces seasonal floods</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>Tourism is non-existent</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>It is Indonesia's capital</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>The city has no economy</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">25.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Pilih pernyataan yang BENAR berdasarkan teks tentang Jakarta! (Lebih dari satu jawaban)</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>It is a center for trade</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>The city is rural</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>Traffic is a problem</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>It is only for government</span></p></div></div></div><div style=""></div><div data-subsection="soal-kisi" style="margin-top: 24px;"><h2 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">KISI-KISI / ANALISIS BUTIR SOAL</h2><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;"