adding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 10%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 20%;">Kunci</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pembahasan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 10%;">Skor</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">1</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text states they are found in Komodo National Park.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Komodo dragons are described as carnivores.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text explicitly mentions their skin is covered in tough scales.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">A</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>As large carnivores, they need space to hunt pigs and deer.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text states it has no visible leaves, roots, or stems.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The smell mimics rotting meat to attract flies.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">7</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The text provides factual information about a specific plant.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">8</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Parasitic plants rely on other plants for nutrients.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">9</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It is famous for being the world's largest individual flower.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">10</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">B</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The title should reflect the main subject.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">4</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">Pilihan Ganda Kompleks / Benar-Salah</h3><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 8%;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left; width: 32%;">Kunci / Pernyataan Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pembahasan Singkat</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 8%;">Skor</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">11</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Wayang Kulit puppets are made of cotton</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>A dalang controls the puppets</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Oil lamps illuminate the screen</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Puppets are made of buffalo hide, not cotton.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">12</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The show is a Javanese tradition</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Bamboo sticks are used for the puppets</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The screen is made of metal</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The screen is made of cotton fabric.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">13</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Rainforests release carbon dioxide</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They are called the lungs of the planet</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They have high biodiversity</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Rainforests absorb carbon dioxide, not release it.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">14</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Protecting forests helps climate change</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Rainforests have simple ecosystems</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Oxygen is produced by these forests</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Rainforests have complex, not simple, ecosystems.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">15</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Jakarta is the capital of Indonesia</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The city has no traffic issues</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>It is a center for economy</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Jakarta faces significant traffic congestion.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">16</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Jakarta is a hub for tourism</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Seasonal flooding is a challenge</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The city is a small village</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Jakarta is a massive metropolitan hub.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">17</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They are small lizards</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They can reach 3 meters</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They eat plants only</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>They are large lizards and carnivores.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">18</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>It smells like flowers</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>It is found in Sumatra</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>It attracts flies</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>It smells like rotting meat.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">19</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The puppets use bamboo</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The show is done in the dark</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>The puppets are made of hide</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>The screen is illuminated by an oil lamp.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">20</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ol style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They absorb carbon dioxide</span> — <strong>Benar</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>Species are not unique there</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span>They are globally irrelevant</span> — <strong>Salah</strong></li></ol></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Rainforests are crucial for global biodiversity.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">5</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">21</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">1</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">3</li></ul></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Only statement 1 and 3 are supported by the text.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">22</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">1</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">3</li></ul></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Jakarta is a government and economic center.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">23</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">1</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">2</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">4</li></ul></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Text highlights its vibrancy, traffic challenges, and trade hub status.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">24</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">1</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">3</li></ul></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Flooding and status as capital are mentioned.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">25</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;"><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">1</li><li style="margin: 2px 0px;">3</li></ul></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Trade hub, traffic issues, and multi-purpose function.</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">6</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 18px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">Pedoman Penilaian</h3><p style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Skor Maksimal:</span> 125</p><p style="margin: 2px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Rumus Nilai:</span> (Skor Perolehan / Skor Maksimal) x 100</p></div></div></div></div><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-2-d7d880a0:materi" data-v2-export-jenis="materi" data-v2-export-pertemuan="2" class="page-break-before" style="break-before: page;"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 2 — Materi</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="materi" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><div style=""></div><h2 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(204, 85, 38); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">📚 Mastering Report Text: Observing the World Around Us</h2><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">📖 Pendahuluan</h3><p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px;"><span>Pernah gak sih kalian penasaran kenapa kucing selalu mendarat dengan kakinya, atau gimana cara kerja smartphone yang kalian pegang tiap hari? Nah, di pertemuan kedua ini, kita bakal mendalami lebih jauh tentang 'Report Text'. Kalau kemarin kita sudah bahas dasar-dasarnya, sekarang saatnya kita bedah anatominya! Materi ini penting banget supaya kalian gak cuma sekadar tahu informasi, tapi juga bisa menyusun laporan yang keren dan faktual tentang fenomena di sekitar kalian. Bayangkan kalian jadi seorang reporter atau ilmuwan muda yang harus menjelaskan sesuatu secara objektif—seperti menjelaskan tren media sosial, fenomena alam, atau benda teknologi favorit kalian. Dengan memahami Report Text, kalian bisa menyajikan fakta secara sistematis, jelas, dan bikin pembaca langsung paham dalam sekali baca. Yuk, kita mulai petualangan bahasa Inggris hari ini!</span></p></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); display: flex;"><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: rgb(204, 85, 38); color: white; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;">1</span><span style="color: rgb(204, 85, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;">The DNA of Report Text: Structure &amp; Features</span></div><div style="border-left: 4px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 247, 237); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-radius: 0px 6px 6px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11pt;">🎯 <span>💡 Report text punya struktur unik yaitu General Classification dan Description, serta menggunakan simple present tense untuk fakta ilmiah.</span></span></div><div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px;">Kenapa sih sebuah tulisan disebut Report Text? Karena tujuannya adalah memberikan informasi tentang sesuatu apa adanya, hasil dari pengamatan atau penelitian. Berbeda dengan teks cerita (narrative) yang isinya imajinasi, report text itu isinya fakta! <ul><li><b>General Classification:</b> Bagian pembuka yang mengenalkan objek secara umum.</li><li><b>Description:</b> Bagian isi yang menjelaskan detail objek, mulai dari ciri fisik, bagian-bagiannya, kebiasaan, atau fungsinya.</li><li><b>Language Features:</b> Kita wajib pakai <i>Simple Present Tense</i> karena fakta itu berlaku selamanya (seperti 'The sun rises in the east'). Kita juga pakai <i>Technical Terms</i> (istilah teknis) untuk kesan yang lebih profesional.</li></ul></div><div style="background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><div style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">📝 Bedah Contoh:</div><div style="line-height: 1.7;"><ul><li><b>General Classification:</b> 'Smartphones are portable electronic devices that have become essential in modern life.' (Ini definisi umum).</li><li><b>Description:</b> 'They consist of a high-resolution touchscreen, a powerful processor, and various built-in sensors.' (Ini detail bagian-bagiannya).</li></ul></div></div><div style="margin-top: 8px;"><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: rgb(254, 252, 232); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 600;">🔑 General Classification, Description, Simple Present Tense, Technical Terms</span></div><div style="clear: both;"></div></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); display: flex;"><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: rgb(204, 85, 38); color: white; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;">2</span><span style="color: rgb(204, 85, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;">Model Teks: The Wonders of Social Media</span></div><div style="border-left: 4px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 247, 237); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-radius: 0px 6px 6px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11pt;">🎯 <span>📖 Mari kita baca contoh teks berikut untuk memahami strukturnya.</span></span></div><div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px;">Social media refers to websites and applications that enable users to create and share content or to participate in social networking. In the current digital era, almost every teenager owns at least one social media account to stay connected with friends and express their creativity.<br><br>Technically, social media platforms are built on complex algorithms. These algorithms analyze user preferences based on their likes, comments, and watch time. The structure of these platforms usually includes a profile page, a feed system, and an interactive messaging feature. Some popular platforms focus on visual content like images and short videos, while others emphasize text-based discussions or professional networking. <br><br>In conclusion, social media is a powerful tool for communication and entertainment. However, it requires a balanced usage to ensure that it brings positive impacts rather than becoming a source of stress. By understanding how these platforms function, users can navigate the digital world more effectively and safely.</div><div style="background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><div style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">🔍 Analisis Struktur:</div><div style="line-height: 1.7;"><ul><li><b>Paragraph 1 (General Classification):</b> 'Social media refers to websites and applications...' (Mengidentifikasi objek secara umum).</li><li><b>Paragraph 2 (Description):</b> 'Technically, social media platforms are built on complex algorithms...' (Menjelaskan detail fitur dan cara kerja).</li><li><b>Paragraph 3 (Conclusion):</b> 'In conclusion, social media is a powerful tool...' (Penutup yang merangkum peran objek).</li><li><b>Kosakata Kunci:</b> 1. <i>Algorithms</i> (prosedur langkah demi langkah untuk menyelesaikan masalah/perhitungan data). 2. <i>Essential</i> (sangat penting/perlu).</li></ul></div></div><div style="clear: both;"></div></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); display: flex;"><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: rgb(204, 85, 38); color: white; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;">3</span><span style="color: rgb(204, 85, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;">Analyzing Information: Fact vs. Opinion</span></div><div style="border-left: 4px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 247, 237); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-radius: 0px 6px 6px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11pt;">🎯 <span>🔍 Kunci utama teks laporan adalah objektivitas, jadi kita harus bisa membedakan fakta yang bisa dibuktikan dengan opini pribadi.</span></span></div><div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px;">Pernah gak kalian baca berita dan bingung mana yang beneran terjadi sama mana yang cuma pendapat penulisnya? Di Report Text, kita dilarang memasukkan opini seperti 'I think' atau 'It is beautiful'. Kenapa? Karena report text harus objektif. Kalau kita bilang 'Smartphone is the best invention', itu opini. Tapi kalau kita bilang 'Smartphone is a device that connects people globally', itu adalah fakta. <ul><li>Gunakan data yang bisa diuji kebenarannya.</li><li>Hindari kata-kata yang bersifat emosional atau subjektif.</li><li>Fokus pada fungsi, karakteristik, dan klasifikasi.</li></ul></div><div style="background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><div style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">📝 Bedah Contoh:</div><div style="line-height: 1.7;"><ul><li><b>Fakta:</b> 'The battery lasts for 12 hours.' (Bisa diukur).</li><li><b>Opini:</b> 'The battery is totally amazing!' (Subjektif, tergantung selera).</li></ul></div></div><div style="clear: both;"></div></div></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><div style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); display: flex;"><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: rgb(204, 85, 38); color: white; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;">4</span><span style="color: rgb(204, 85, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;">Drafting Your Report: Multimodal Project</span></div><div style="border-left: 4px solid rgb(204, 85, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 247, 237); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-radius: 0px 6px 6px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 11pt;">🎯 <span>🚀 Saatnya beraksi! Kalian akan merancang laporan multimodal tentang hobi atau teknologi yang kalian sukai.</span></span></div><div style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px;">Sekarang giliran kalian! Kalian akan membuat 'Multimodal Report'. Apa itu? Laporan yang menggabungkan teks dengan elemen visual seperti gambar, infografis, atau diagram. Bayangkan kalian membuat slide presentasi atau postingan edukatif di Instagram tentang 'Skateboard', 'Gaming Console', atau 'K-Pop Culture'. <ul><li>Langkah 1: Pilih topik yang kalian kuasai.</li><li>Langkah 2: Cari informasi faktual (bukan opini).</li><li>Langkah 3: Tulis dalam 3 paragraf (Classification, Description, Summary).</li><li>Langkah 4: Tambahkan gambar atau ikon yang mendukung penjelasan kalian.</li></ul></div><div style="background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246); padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><div style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">📝 Bedah Contoh:</div><div style="line-height: 1.7;"><ul><li><b>Topik:</b> Mechanical Keyboard.</li><li><b>Visual:</b> Tambahkan foto keyboard dengan keterangan bagian-bagiannya seperti 'Switches', 'Keycaps', dan 'PCB'.</li><li><b>Kalimat Majemuk:</b> 'Mechanical keyboards are popular among gamers, <i>and</i> they offer a better typing experience <i>because</i> the switches are more tactile.'</li></ul></div></div><div style="clear: both;"></div></div></div><div style="margin-top: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">💡 Tahukah Kamu?</h3><p style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; background-color: rgb(254, 252, 232); padding: 12px;"><span>Tahukah kalian bahwa bahasa Inggris untuk Report Text selalu menggunakan 'General Noun' (kata benda umum)? Contohnya kita menggunakan 'Cats' (kucing secara umum) dan bukan 'My cat, Luna' (kucing spesifik milik kita sendiri). Selain itu, teks laporan sering menggunakan 'Technical Verbs' seperti 'consists of', 'functions as', atau 'is classified as'.</span></p></div><div style="margin-top: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 12px;">📖 Glosarium</h3><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(243, 244, 246);"><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px; text-align: left; width: 30%;">Istilah</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px; text-align: left;">Definisi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Algorithm</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px;">Sistem instruksi otomatis yang menentukan konten apa yang dilihat pengguna.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Multimodal</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px;">Penggunaan lebih dari satu mode komunikasi, seperti teks dikombinasikan dengan gambar atau video.</td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Objectivity</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 8px;">Sikap menyampaikan informasi berdasarkan fakta tanpa dipengaruhi perasaan pribadi.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-top: 24px;"><h3 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 8px;">📚 Referensi</h3><ul style="margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;"><li>Kemendikbudristek (2022). Buku Panduan Guru Bahasa Inggris: English for Change untuk SMP Kelas IX.</li><li>Cambridge Dictionary Online.</li><li>Oxford Learner's Dictionaries.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div data-v2-export-item="pertemuan-2-d7d880a0:refleksi" data-v2-export-jenis="refleksi" data-v2-export-pertemuan="2" class="page-break-before" style="break-before: page;"><div data-v2-export-marker="true" style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Pertemuan 2 — Refleksi</div><div class="document-preview bg-white mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 text-black" style="width: 100%; max-width: 210mm;"><div data-section="tindakLanjut" style="display: block; margin-top: 0px;"><h2 style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;">Refleksi &amp; Tindak Lanjut</h2><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black; margin-bottom: 16px;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(254, 202, 202);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px;">Remedial</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 16px; vertical-align: top;"><span><p style="margin:6px 0">Diagnosis kesulitan dilakukan melalui identifikasi ketidakmampuan siswa dalam membedakan struktur teks laporan dan penggunaan kalimat majemuk. Siswa yang belum mencapai TP1 dan TP2 akan diberikan sesi pendampingan khusus untuk memetahakan kembali bagian-bagian teks laporan secara visual.</p><p style="margin:6px 0">Strategi yang diterapkan adalah pembelajaran berbasis tutor sebaya di mana siswa yang telah kompeten membimbing siswa yang belum tuntas. Fokus utama adalah pada penyederhanaan kalimat kompleks menjadi kalimat tunggal yang benar secara tata bahasa sebelum beranjak ke struktur yang lebih rumit.</p><p style="margin:6px 0">Contoh kegiatan remedial meliputi pengisian lembar kerja 'Sentence Building Blocks' di mana siswa menyusun ulang kata-kata menjadi kalimat laporan yang koheren. Kegiatan ini diintegrasikan dengan program bimbingan belajar tambahan di luar jam sekolah untuk memastikan target ketuntasan tercapai secara personal.</p></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="relative group/editable" style=""><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded pointer-events-none ring-0 group-hover/editable:ring-2 group-hover/editable:ring-primary/30 transition-all duration-150"></div><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid black;"><thead><tr style="background-color: rgb(209, 250, 229);"><th style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px;">Pengayaan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 16px; vertical-align: top;"><span><p style="margin:6px 0">Siswa yang telah melampaui tujuan pembelajaran diberikan tantangan untuk mengeksplorasi teks laporan yang lebih kompleks dengan topik saintifik atau isu sosial terkini. Fokus pengayaan adalah pada peningkatan kualitas kohesi dan koherensi antar paragraf menggunakan konjungsi yang lebih variatif.</p><p style="margin:6px 0">Strategi yang digunakan adalah penugasan mandiri berbasis proyek (project-based learning) di mana siswa diminta membuat laporan multimodal menggunakan platform digital seperti infografis interaktif atau video pendek. Mereka didorong untuk menyertakan data statistik atau fakta pendukung yang valid dari sumber tepercaya.</p><p style="margin:6px 0">Contoh kegiatan pengayaan mencakup pembuatan 'Expert Report' di mana siswa harus melakukan riset kecil tentang fenomena alam di lingkungan sekitar dan mempresentasikannya di depan kelas. Program ini diintegrasikan dengan pengembangan literasi digital sekolah untuk membiasakan siswa menggunakan teknologi dalam mendiseminasikan informasi.</p></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></body></html>